From 0f5a1ea509aeb1057dd96c1b53869572b337f40a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 05:41:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Python backend (aiohttp + nats-py) with identical
 wire protocol
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implements server_py/ as a drop-in Python alternative to the Node.js backend:
- Same WebSocket JSON protocol (connect/publish/disconnect ↔ connected/message/subjects/published/error)
- UTF-8 round-trip detection for binary payloads, base64 fallback
- Discovery via NATS '>' wildcard subscription with subject deduplication
- aiohttp WebSocket server + static file serving + SPA fallback
- argparse CLI: --server/-s, --port/-p, --no-open
- Run with: python -m server_py [--server nats://localhost:4222]

https://claude.ai/code/session_01AkrmDxxeHDSgFUecYSnsXa
